### ============================================================================
### ParkFlow - Suite End-to-End vía Traefik Reverse Proxy (REST Client VS Code)
### ============================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost
@adminEmail = admin@parkflow.local
@adminPassword = CambiaEstaClave123

### Claves de idempotencia fijas para probar reintentos determinísticos (HT-10)
@entradaKey = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111101
@entradaDuplicadaKey = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111199
@salidaKey = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222201
@entradaMotoKey = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111102
@salidaMotoKey = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222202
@cajaKey = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333301
@reservaKey = 44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444401
@reservaSolapeKey = 44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444499
@checkInKey = 55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555501
@reservaCancelarKey = 44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444402

### ============================================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS (HT-07) & JWKS
### ============================================================================

### 1.1 Actuator Health - Identity Service (vía Traefik -> /actuator/health)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/identity

### 1.2 Actuator Health - Parking Service (vía Traefik -> /actuator/health)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/parking

### 1.3 Actuator Health - Billing Service (vía Traefik -> /actuator/health)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/billing

### 1.4 Health Endpoint custom de Parking y Billing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/health

### 1.5 Claves públicas JWKS RS256 de Identity
GET {{baseUrl}}/.well-known/jwks.json

### ============================================================================
### 2. REGISTRO INICIAL (SOLO EN BD VACÍA) Y LOGIN
### ============================================================================

### 2.1 Registrar primer administrador (si aún no existe en db_identity)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Administrador ParkFlow",
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### 2.2 Login y captura automática del token JWT
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Variable dinámica @token extraída del login
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2.3 Verificar identidad actual (/api/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================================
### 3. TOPOLOGÍA DEL PARQUEADERO (PISO, ZONA, ESPACIOS Y DISPONIBILIDAD)
### ============================================================================

### 3.1 Crear Piso (soporta sótanos desde -5 gracias a Parking V5)
# @name crearPiso
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pisos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "P1",
  "nombre": "Piso 1 Principal",
  "orden": 1
}

###
@pisoId = {{crearPiso.response.body.id}}

### 3.2 Crear Zona en el Piso
# @name crearZona
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zonas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pisoId": "{{pisoId}}",
  "codigo": "Z-A",
  "nombre": "Zona A Mixta",
  "descripcion": "Zona principal cerca de acceso"
}

###
@zonaId = {{crearZona.response.body.id}}

### 3.3 Crear Espacio para CARRO
# @name crearEspacioCarro
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/espacios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zonaId": "{{zonaId}}",
  "codigo": "C-01",
  "tipo": "CARRO"
}

###
@espacioId = {{crearEspacioCarro.response.body.id}}

### 3.4 Crear Espacio para MOTO
# @name crearEspacioMoto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/espacios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zonaId": "{{zonaId}}",
  "codigo": "M-01",
  "tipo": "MOTO"
}

###
@espacioMotoId = {{crearEspacioMoto.response.body.id}}

### 3.5 Consultar disponibilidad inicial (ambos disponibles = true, ocupado = false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/espacios?pisoId={{pisoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================================
### 4. ENTRADA CON IDEMPOTENCY-KEY + PRUEBA DE REINTENTO Y NO DUPLICIDAD (HT-10)
### ============================================================================

### 4.1 Registrar entrada de CARRO en espacio C-01
# @name entradaCarro
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones/entradas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{entradaKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "ABC123",
  "tipoVehiculo": "CARRO",
  "espacioId": "{{espacioId}}"
}

###
@sesionId = {{entradaCarro.response.body.id}}
@ticket = {{entradaCarro.response.body.numeroTicket}}

### 4.2 REINTENTO con la MISMA Idempotency-Key (debe devolver el mismo tiquete sin duplicar sesión)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones/entradas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{entradaKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "ABC123",
  "tipoVehiculo": "CARRO",
  "espacioId": "{{espacioId}}"
}

### 4.3 Prueba de rechazo por placa activa duplicada con otra Idempotency-Key (espera 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones/entradas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{entradaDuplicadaKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "ABC123",
  "tipoVehiculo": "CARRO",
  "espacioId": "{{espacioId}}"
}

### 4.4 Verificar que C-01 aparece ocupado = true, disponible = false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/espacios?pisoId={{pisoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================================
### 5. SALIDA DENTRO DE PERIODO DE GRACIA (15 MIN -> GRATUITA) (HT-05)
### ============================================================================

### 5.1 Solicitar salida del CARRO (Parking invoca a Billing /internal/v1/liquidaciones -> GRATUITA)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones/{{ticket}}/salida
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{salidaKey}}

### ============================================================================
### 6. FLUJO COMPLETO DE COBRO: LIQUIDACIÓN + CAJA + PAGO EN EFECTIVO + CIERRE
### ============================================================================

### 6.1 Registrar entrada de MOTO en espacio M-01
# @name entradaMoto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones/entradas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{entradaMotoKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "MOT99A",
  "tipoVehiculo": "MOTO",
  "espacioId": "{{espacioMotoId}}"
}

###
@sesionMotoId = {{entradaMoto.response.body.id}}
@ticketMoto = {{entradaMoto.response.body.numeroTicket}}

### 6.2 Crear liquidación facturable en Billing (2h -> supera 15 min de gracia -> $7.000 COP, estado PENDIENTE)
# @name crearLiquidacion
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/liquidaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{salidaMotoKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sesionId": "{{sesionMotoId}}",
  "numeroTicket": "{{ticketMoto}}",
  "tipoVehiculo": "MOTO",
  "placa": "MOT99A",
  "fechaEntrada": "2026-11-25T10:00:00Z",
  "fechaCorte": "2026-11-25T12:00:00Z"
}

###
@liquidacionId = {{crearLiquidacion.response.body.id}}
@pagoId = {{crearLiquidacion.response.body.pago.id}}

### 6.3 Crear Caja física en Billing
# @name crearCaja
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/cajas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "CAJA-01",
  "nombre": "Caja Principal",
  "descripcion": "Caja de recaudo en efectivo puerta principal"
}

###
@cajaId = {{crearCaja.response.body.id}}

### 6.4 Abrir sesión de caja con saldo inicial
# @name abrirCaja
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/billing/cajas/sesiones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{cajaKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cajaId": "{{cajaId}}",
  "saldoInicial": 100000.00,
  "observacion": "Apertura de turno operativo"
}

###
@sesionCajaId = {{abrirCaja.response.body.id}}

### 6.5 Resolver pago en efectivo (aprueba pago, registra movimiento de caja y emite comprobante)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/pagos/{{pagoId}}/resolver
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metodo": "EFECTIVO",
  "sesionCajaId": "{{sesionCajaId}}"
}

### 6.6 Confirmar salida en Parking con la misma Idempotency-Key (cierra sesión y libera espacio M-01)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesiones/{{ticketMoto}}/salida
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{salidaMotoKey}}

### 6.7 Consultar liquidación final en Billing (estado PAGADA + comprobante)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/liquidaciones/{{liquidacionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6.8 Verificar disponibilidad final de espacios (C-01 y M-01 nuevamente disponible = true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/espacios?pisoId={{pisoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================================
### 7. RESERVACIONES ANTICIPADAS (FLYWAY V6 + CHECK-IN + CANCELACIÓN)
### ============================================================================

### 7.1 Crear reservación anticipada de CARRO en C-01
# @name crearReserva
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{reservaKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "RES101",
  "tipoVehiculo": "CARRO",
  "espacioId": "{{espacioId}}",
  "fechaInicio": "2026-11-26T14:00:00Z",
  "fechaFin": "2026-11-26T18:00:00Z",
  "observacion": "Reserva cliente frecuente"
}

###
@reservaId = {{crearReserva.response.body.id}}

### 7.2 Reintento idempotente de reserva (debe devolver la misma reserva sin duplicar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{reservaKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "RES101",
  "tipoVehiculo": "CARRO",
  "espacioId": "{{espacioId}}",
  "fechaInicio": "2026-11-26T14:00:00Z",
  "fechaFin": "2026-11-26T18:00:00Z",
  "observacion": "Reserva cliente frecuente"
}

### 7.3 Prueba de rechazo por cruce horario en el mismo espacio (espera 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{reservaSolapeKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "RES202",
  "tipoVehiculo": "CARRO",
  "espacioId": "{{espacioId}}",
  "fechaInicio": "2026-11-26T15:00:00Z",
  "fechaFin": "2026-11-26T17:00:00Z"
}

### 7.4 Listar reservaciones activas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservas?estado=ACTIVA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7.5 Check-in de la reserva (convierte la reserva en sesión activa en C-01)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservas/{{reservaId}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{checkInKey}}

### 7.6 Crear segunda reserva (MOTO) y cancelarla
# @name crearReservaMoto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{reservaCancelarKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "MOT77C",
  "tipoVehiculo": "MOTO",
  "espacioId": "{{espacioMotoId}}",
  "fechaInicio": "2026-11-26T19:00:00Z",
  "fechaFin": "2026-11-26T21:00:00Z"
}

###
@reservaMotoId = {{crearReservaMoto.response.body.id}}

### 7.7 Cancelar reserva
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reservas/{{reservaMotoId}}/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "motivo": "El usuario reprogramó su visita"
}
